      "id": "claim_d8005d204d0040699ab145b8cf6a2e7b",
      "statement": "The production configuration targets a single A100 workload with `batch_size=96`, `seq_len=2048`, `gradient_checkpointing=True`, `ce_chunk_size=256`, BF16/TF32 settings, z-loss enabled at `1e-4`, and `torch.compile(mode='reduce-overhead')`; the repository treats the 256-row chunk size as a load-bearing invariant.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://README.md#L251-L261",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:beff0c0aae1f7a85b32b561e059064080cccbab306790f471e31e2fc729fa13a:"
