      "id": "claim_75649648279b4c1fb97f1312c5da93ab",
      "statement": "`chunked_cross_entropy_with_z` and `chunked_head_cross_entropy_with_z` have distinct contracts: the former accepts already-materialized logits and chunks only the loss calculation, while the latter computes `F.linear` in row slices inside checkpointed calls and is the memory-bounded LM-head path.",
