      "id": "claim_aa79bc8df3fb41c9805d3e28f373e5b0",
      "statement": "The standalone Triton CE implementation has different edge semantics from the pure-PyTorch path: its z reduction currently includes every row and its kernel loads the target logit before checking validity, so ignored-target or uneven-chunk cases are not a general equivalence guarantee for the Triton head path.",
