      "id": "claim_a671b0cd9c7842c387ad10b67dd31b68",
      "statement": "RMSNorm uses the `x * rsqrt(mean(x^2) + eps) * weight` formulation with `eps=1e-5`, and QK-Norm optionally applies RMSNorm to each projected query and key head before RoPE; disabling QK-Norm substitutes identity modules.",
