    {
      "id": "claim_2892ed81e55e42f5987fddab2596b383",
      "statement": "GroupedQueryAttention projects 8 query heads and 4 key/value heads, repeats each KV head according to `n_heads // n_kv_heads`, and calls causal `F.scaled_dot_product_attention`; the repository therefore relies on PyTorch SDPA backend dispatch and does not implement a persistent KV cache.",
