      "statement": "The focused tests protect the memory and numerical contracts: model tests cover checkpointed versus ordinary outputs, CE/z equivalence, ignored-target masking, dense versus head-bounded loss, gradients, GQA, RMSNorm, SwiGLU, and QK-Norm; smoke tests exercise the same loss boundary end to end; GPU smoke checks Triton references only when CUDA and Triton are available.",
